[00:12.76]1. How great is the honor, Jehovah,
[00:25.53]To build you a place for your name!
[00:30.53]We offer it now with rejoicing
[00:36.53]To add to your glory and fame.
[00:42.53]Whatever the things we may give you,
[00:48.48]They rightly were yours from the start.
[00:54.48]Our labor, our skill, our possessions,
[01:00.48]We joyfully give from the heart.
[01:03.48](Chorus)
[01:06.48]May we present this place to you,
[01:09.40]And here may your name be known.
[01:16.07]We dedicate this place to you;
[01:22.74]Please accept it as your own.
[01:49.24]2. And now may we honor you, Father,
[01:55.39]By filling this place with your praise.
[02:00.09]May glory ascend with the increase
[02:07.87]Of those who are learning your ways.
[02:12.07]Committing this place to your worship,
[02:18.34]We give it our generous care.
[02:24.62]And long may it stand as a witness,
[02:30.62]Supporting the message we bear.
[02:33.62](Chorus)
[02:36.62]May we present this place to you,
[02:42.45]And here may your name be known.
[02:48.28]We dedicate this place to you;
[03:04.01]Please accept it as your own.